Verify (run as the postgres OS user):
  sudo runuser -u postgres -- psql -p 5432 -c 'SELECT application_name, state, sync_state FROM pg_stat_replication;'
  sudo runuser -u postgres -- psql -p 5433 -c 'SELECT pg_is_in_recovery();'
Then follow 04_replica_test_guide.md to show the replica rejecting
writes and streaming new rows from the primary.
